THAT the District Golfers will lose about $500OOO
nually which was derived from liquor licenses;
THAT approximately 1900 arrested for drunken
during the past year;
THAT knows how many will be brought into court
to answer this charge during the coming year;
THAT Washington breweres will continue operate after
November but they will manufacture ice cream
soda water and nonalcoholic drinks;
THAT you cannot buy nor sell any more liquor in the
District of Columbia after next Wednesday, but
THAT you are still permitted to drink it; and
THAT there will be many ways by which you get


nip" but one seems to know how much liquor
you allowed to import nor how you import;
THAT some one will be arrested for violation of the law
THAT the law may seize that little treasure stock you
have been so industriously boarding and carefully
guarding;


THAT it will be illegal to give your friend drink of this
personal stock after November l.
THAT officials think the Sheppard dry law is the best
thing ever happened to the Nations Capital;
THAT others think it is all hard luck.

